# Brand and git principles

## Brand

- Public product name is **Brave New World** (English) / **멋진 신세계** (Korean).
- Never use **GeoWatch** / **geowatch** as user-facing branding, titles, package display name, or outbound User-Agent.
- Prefer `@/lib/brand` (`BRAND_NAME`, `brandName()`, `BRAND_USER_AGENT`) for user-visible strings.
- Huxley’s novel may be cited as the literary motif; the product name and the novel title are the same phrase on purpose.

## Git push

- When the user asks to push completed work, update **both** `main` and `dev` (merge or push as appropriate)—not only one branch.
